## N5 merge gate: resolved the manus-parity conflict in src/graph/runGraph.ts

`.jgatefail.txt` reported:

```
MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity in: src/graph/runGraph.ts. Run git merge
manus-parity, resolve those files keeping both sides, commit.
```

### Root cause

`git merge manus-parity` (parity tip `495ac5f`, the V8 merge) auto-merged three of the
four files it touched (`src/agent/events.ts`, `src/agent/loop.ts`, `src/config.ts`), all of
which carried N10/O5/V8 content on disjoint paths from N5's. `src/graph/runGraph.ts`
conflicted because both sides edited the same `case` run of `RunGraph.apply`'s switch:

- **ours (HEAD `8d55bdc`)** added the N5-only `case "context_selected":` above
  `case "video_studio_command":`, with a comment explaining that the selector re-shapes the
  transcript each step and is therefore a per-step diagnostic like `cache_usage` rather
  than a canvas node.
- **theirs (parity `495ac5f`)** added `case "workspace_command":` and
  `case "workspace_open_request":` in the same position for the workspace relay.

Both sides were additive in the same spot, so the resolution is the union of the two case
lists.

### Resolution

Removed the three conflict-marker lines only. The resolved run keeps both sides:

```ts
case "cache_usage":
// Neo N5: the selector re-shapes the transcript every step, so it is a
// per-step diagnostic like cache_usage rather than a canvas node (a node
// per step would bury the run graph's real structure).
case "context_selected":
case "workspace_command":
case "video_studio_command":
case "workspace_open_request":
case "simulation_progress":
  // Live-only signals with no canvas node of their own.
  return [];
```

No line of either side was dropped, no test was weakened, and no case was reordered
relative to its own side.

### Nothing else was touched

No source file was edited beyond removing the three marker lines in `runGraph.ts`. The
three auto-merged files were committed as merged (`src/agent/events.ts` gains parity's
`workspace_command` / `workspace_open_request` events plus N7's `ok` flag;
`src/agent/loop.ts` keeps N10's `runAbArm` / `armPromises` / `eventLogSession` wiring and
parity's A/B and O5 additions; `src/config.ts` gains parity's `DESIGN_REGISTRY_DIR`).
`git merge-base --is-ancestor manus-parity HEAD` exits 0 and a fresh `git merge manus-parity`
on the committed tree reports "Already up to date."

