| runGraph suite (conflicted file) | `node --import tsx --test src/graph/__tests__/runGraph.test.ts` | 27 tests, 27 pass, 0 fail |
| loop suites (auto-merged) | `node --import tsx --test src/agent/__tests__/loop*.test.ts` | 19 tests, 19 pass, 0 fail |

`git grep -n "^<<<<<<<\|^=======$\|^>>>>>>>" -- src packages` is empty and `git diff --check`
is clean.

### Final state

`HEAD = c42bfc9` (two-parent merge, first parent `8d55bdc`, second parent `495ac5f`).
`git status --porcelain` is clean apart from this rollup file and untracked `tmp-*` scratch
from earlier sessions.

### Files

`.jdone` (this report prepended to the preserved rollup), plus the resolved
`src/graph/runGraph.ts` in the merge commit.

